cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. If you use the downscaled data, also cite the
  source simulations listed at https://sai-downscaling.readthedocs.io/access-data/licenses.html.
type: software
title: "carbonplan / sai-downscaling"
abstract: >-
  A scalable, cloud-native pipeline for downscaling Stratospheric Aerosol Injection (SAI) climate
  model outputs. It implements Bias-Correction and Spatial-Disaggregation (BCSD) and Quantile Delta
  Mapping with Spatial Disaggregation (QDMSD), and applies them to daily CESM2-WACCM6 and
  UKESM1-1-LL output from the historical, SSP2-4.5, and G6-1.5K-SAI scenarios, plus a CESM2-WACCM6
  G6-1.5K-SAI termination-shock run, trained on daily ERA5 reanalysis.
